| Boss Raid Lv.2 |     Floor 50 |  10 Party |  50 Hero | Greater Raid Boss |

### Unlock Rule

```text
Master mencapai Floor 25
        ↓
Boss Raid Lv.1 Unlock
        ↓
Master mencapai Floor 50
        ↓
Boss Raid Lv.2 Unlock
```

Boss Raid Lv.2 tidak dapat dimainkan sebelum Floor 50 terbuka.

