# 16. PARTY ROLE SYSTEM

Setiap Party dapat mempunyai fungsi berbeda.

```text
PARTY 1
Main DPS

PARTY 2
Tank / Frontline

PARTY 3
Healer / Support

PARTY 4
Magic DPS

PARTY 5
Utility / Control
```

Untuk Raid Lv.2:

```text
PARTY 1  → Main DPS
PARTY 2  → Tank
PARTY 3  → Healer
PARTY 4  → Magic DPS
PARTY 5  → Physical DPS
PARTY 6  → Support
PARTY 7  → Control
PARTY 8  → Secondary DPS
PARTY 9  → Recovery
PARTY 10 → Reserve / Utility
```

Pembagian tersebut merupakan rekomendasi AI Fairy dan tetap dapat berubah berdasarkan komposisi Hero.

